Revision history for skills

{{$NEXT}}

0.2.0     2026-10-13 05:16:08Z
  - New group storytold-craft: sixteen skills for operating the Storytold
    Craft editors as an agent, one per application plus an overview.
  - New skill getty-perl-sugar: declarative Perl DSL sugar on
    Moose::Exporter, with a metadata registry and one shared runner.
  - New groups codex, databases, hermes-agent and social-media.
  - New skills skill-mining, claude-cross-session,
    claude-code-plugin-engineering, getty-perl-typing, perl-alien,
    perl-mojo, perl-xs, docker-engine-api, hetzner-operator, ssl-tls-pki
    and vllm-operator.
  - docker, docker-registry, docker-engine-api and rex are routers over a
    reference tree; getty-rex is named rex.
  - getty-create-software lives in the development group.
  - getty-perl-kubernetes-classes, getty-perl-release-author-getty and
    perl-www-crawl4ai live in the repos that own their subject.
  - Skills are installed with skilletor; bin/check-listings holds the
    READMEs and both plugin manifests against the directories.
  - getty-git-commit-style prescribes one Changes file in the CPAN format
    for every repo.
  - Skill descriptions state when to load the skill, not what it contains.

0.1.0     2026-08-19 06:19:36Z
  - Initial library: authoring, claude, development, git, perl and
    system-and-network-administration, shipped as a plugin for Claude Code
    and for Codex.
